Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:22.61,歌词 日语,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5F20FE&\3c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&}じゃあね また明日
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.75,0:22:22.61,歌词 中文,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5F20FE&\3c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&}那 明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.69,歌词 日语,,0,0,0,,{\c&H5F20FE&\3c&H000000&\4c&HFFFFFF&}帰り道に
